{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8d16fd07c45f3250a779fa1c07845eb79a27c06491e4fb222e41e1312c0fcfb5",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8902b61c95b06607883b6cef1cac707314853320fd7b665a6a37828d22fd676c",
      "text": "拼尽全力的理由",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9332949a39dc2db890fb1586d3c409af210e7e9f66d7c8026c83af3d11c70a2b",
      "text": "轻音部全员商讨起要在高中生乐队大赛演奏的曲目。\n其间，隼人提议使用原创曲目。\n为了迎接大赛，大家各自面对着自己的课题，\n心怀复杂思绪的旬想起了自己的过去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000027:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a0c7f8f83c9759bf38e90e810580beff52236c88683724b5c13d354d17d97d",
      "text": "第3话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000027:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8902b61c95b06607883b6cef1cac707314853320fd7b665a6a37828d22fd676c",
      "text": "拼尽全力的理由",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59253806272b65d7bd8731420f38fe497196791758372bff3fef3fc20c491e0f",
      "text": "……呼。\n怎么样，我的架子鼓！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1ef7304486c902da6cd9e8ffb44f38461bd5ec444743f13a320eab96e101c7a",
      "text": "很……厉害……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8d22836443161959553bbdced5c28da3c18eb12bf9772fb511b1606698957a1",
      "text": "太棒了！\n什么时候变得这么厉害了啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81899f00c5fb2a3ffa546801083004970906c71181f0d04621f93f0e1c256431",
      "text": "嘿嘿，我和隼人一起去了乐器行，\n买了鼓棒之后就拼命练习了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:750ec7a1167a5513fb143a5b5c08b642c45947d8ca5cb61404cd6db83a71a7dc",
      "text": "因为家里没有架子鼓，\n我就拿杂志当打击垫练个不停呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:978b5c436d88ff7a0f323e672df127f116323e14ee9d1ada68f47e5030a1dff6",
      "text": "话虽如此，能进步到这种程度\n真的很厉害哦，春名！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18fd770aa64c3c2eb6528ac890c35f38fdfa4fff7a7b89b30c47757987d8defc",
      "text": "哎——！居然只有你们2个人去乐器行！？\n太狡猾了～！也要叫上我啊～～！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:393737583fff05199a43be0b5aef081d64f4b605e6af0ff9c0099a7afc3f4041",
      "text": "……四季。下次……大家一起去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0330b88e9906ebfc28d11ae158c7d65ce39e30c964dd906f7788a806a2eaf12e",
      "text": "绝对、绝对、绝——对哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c7e0f4a3aacfe97d1176efda4de3271a9284c6547879818f4614a7daab1761a",
      "text": "说完了吗？今天不是要决定乐队大赛上演奏的\n曲目吗？快点开始吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56a5aa7bcc8abe4d0352a353fcbef2af92fb20a1c290ba1e97fd2b3937d7bfba",
      "text": "那我们就开始讨论乐队大赛上演奏曲目的\n碰头会吧。有建议的人请提出来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12beaea15aa41eb436680303856e95e3988969b204b79a8cabb09e8ee642b7e9",
      "text": "我我有！流行歌曲就不错！\n如果是大家都知道的歌，气氛绝对超嗨的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:886cc3a1fba6043d461d240b2a642373831fd786b13deb9a4106494d54e06545",
      "text": "难道不会和其他参赛者撞车吗？\n太肤浅了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f49252275a3162e872faad14126839420db0bc0b0a61ca2d6e7e0e77eb2bf99",
      "text": "这么一说确实是啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03aa4930692c39370689045c57bfacedb63582ec5ef94199e36238ef67dc154b",
      "text": "那不如干脆挑战难度极高的曲子\n怎么样？让其他人根本模仿不来的那种！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c49b90f56f96e2262b78858255733c0c930befc0596a23d14a00a1fb974b4ffb",
      "text": "你觉得以我们目前的水平，能演奏出别人\n都弹不来的高难度曲子吗？我觉得很悬。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ef6d01c364225921f2c4e87bb27fdc9d8ecbc0d59478a00f06e1728b50f03ea",
      "text": "啊，也是，你说得对……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84b87d6cb2865695fc20d000df4c36f83df3e09ccb08b2900e9c8be977395869",
      "text": "既不和任何人撞车……\n现在的我们又能演奏的曲子……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d844a81b935088cfadd019e041a047e63bae2c1a9e4110141afd46edc5f50d0",
      "text": "那、那个……\n我来写歌吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:147ce9045b6cda8072a9d6ab298272f890256ec610f0ac8e81b1980634ff0adc",
      "text": "如果是原创曲目的话就只有我们能演奏，\n我觉得挺好的。……你们觉得呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65a0dc07da985df6387c127f58cd44f8c7d43771c9e834987ffdf74a6565b929",
      "text": "真的假的！\n隼人，你忙得过来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16ce94efd9e987a162fee56d4e049f2f176ff9bbd927208757df7ae730d51663",
      "text": "那就是说有新歌了对吧！？能够唱到隼人亲的\n新歌，真的太超级开心了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000168:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbde50ebc240a4e7b047aa117a6176ab5f834e418e2437d75bd6e17d71870847",
      "text": "确实我觉得那样最理想，\n不过距离大赛已经没有多少时间了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000174:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d8bcd2d14e88483ee2a957a5f5729ad77a678f657328ca0a6faefabaed4a0ad",
      "text": "隼人，你没问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000181:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d5e6ad94c0a9cbe22a0ce991d102505e9bf78518abac3c538ba0f0d0baa0540",
      "text": "包在我身上！\n我一定会写出一首超级帅气的曲子给你们看的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_b:cmd-000188:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be9662b8a38bbe0fdd7de1f6533e23aa632abffa8f5c2be090c1888de5b3aba9",
      "text": "……那，就拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_c:cmd-000023:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c35cbab0c6ab8533ae2de874a69739211aa0160a60bcc635425af9e1162df55",
      "text": "呼啊啊～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b92570180c0ee66407f39db1e19144d094be2e534036c18fab1b2b6332eff01",
      "text": "隼人，好大一个哈欠……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aad0350f645e84d82e51a910b9876e021899d0c986149f280c749a07af5f2b55",
      "text": "写歌有点卡壳了。都没怎么\n合眼。哥哥还骂我“赶紧去睡觉”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_c:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84bc88bc6bd964915998d0856c70f830d0b38a7961f7222049fc7cbfba2377ba",
      "text": "作曲，看起来好辛苦……\n要是有能做的事……我，来帮忙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_c:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a1ed0dbfc470e0c329418d87000595b51d418635e00682e15bc412f8e7610b1",
      "text": "谢谢！有什么事我会找你的！\n话说春名呢？好像还没来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_c:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:885ab7ce37a0c1fc0ecf4b7bb844a6018135647828cfc20c418b1d57e5007147",
      "text": "春名亲因为打工所以社团活动请假了！\n……呃，x和y……x是3？为什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_c:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ced2457b3cb974481176911abe9c206eebc11e95469b23f05194b6fa8869943",
      "text": "这样啊。\n……等等，四季，你在学习吗？真稀奇啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_c:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df0b7b43822b6b18d8216cb6d5743ee7e1fd95ec93a7f8d5afe9bff5c2255783",
      "text": "之前逃掉的小测验要补考啦！\n所以，现在正让旬亲给我补习数学呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_c:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc75bce04b1abbf903ab45c4035f00ccc8552e298d79e4ede33265cd01d1a876",
      "text": "这次补考要是不及格，四季君就得被禁止参加社团活动了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_c:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50079ce31427b0816c78d73cf4fd5acf36dd1e2da0b632ad20021a2bbb677c3b",
      "text": "怎么这样！旬亲太严格了啦！\n呃，如果x是3的话……y是10？为什么啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_c:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:770e2e0652ddd4a2bd794424748ab4b5cf60a22eb1b9789852c6e8ad2004234f",
      "text": "刚才不是解释过了吗……\n在x=3的情况下，y是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:890e4ffccbb4703e4c719ac629ac70ce4b89b053030a846ce611e02191e6c1e9",
      "text": "……唔——……\n……不行，感觉不对！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5707bb9d190f36e13132fff5bf9834a85324746f42c43013c808bb0bf7badfc1",
      "text": "……呜呜，卷子上写的数学公式看起来像咒语\n一样了～！脑子都要爆炸了！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_d:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6691d141dc281e43f5204d91132df487204e657f41cf1267c86fd3784e9650bd",
      "text": "隼人也是，四季也是……加油……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_d:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7349592bd6449ec2f69d1d7cf74d8eced486b5cd50ddb5462d7e31c78d273376",
      "text": "（隼人宁愿睡眠不足也要写歌，\n却好像没什么进展……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_d:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6143e7a6aae924a46f0e0fdfd521fedfa736637153ca47868181642078f9db1f",
      "text": "（四季君为了讨厌到要逃考的学习，\n拼得头顶都快冒烟了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_d:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9615063837b7b6b9c030cc2c0d1f624396b4c005e0ec83ffd608b6f7f0486fa",
      "text": "（有必要这么拼命吗……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_d:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92f434fffb1cf691c07fa750c6fe859bd9ca9a7e7ea6ea9c620f9cb66f75e8d4",
      "text": "（大家为什么能为了社团，做到这种地步……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_d:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afbd2a46dc781fdbc8a01e89d896c74ab0b635abffe8db415cd8b349347a8826",
      "text": "旬亲～，这里能再给我\n讲一遍吗～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_d:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b946c7b645112ccd54254e93d2c8157aa6b450e951872e004aa21db7cf67d38",
      "text": "唉，真是的……拿你没办法。\n听好了？这里是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_e:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd07b730d3259fce14c48ce671759a89a24ed2cdb24d0a857b7fc10d7be44269",
      "text": "四季，今天的补考……要是能及格就好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62b732c778bd9c7076630e32611c6989f6fbebfde19971e33db782f7d7f88476",
      "text": "是啊。\n要是能记住教给他的东西就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f0963e21fd42f03e923c85766a0a3fdfc44b6782963866d02a9460e2ab7fdf4",
      "text": "反正春名先生也去打工请假了，\n今天就先到此为止吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44f0c0153e50571fe209995206f74f5ad8cd96f98b062e58aab6fac490511cf3",
      "text": "我想再留下来写会儿歌。\n你们两个不用在意，先回去吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_e:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0323532aa17ddf8597d8455d9c07bfcf61b4e75fe79a086cb3c3dea834b59b8",
      "text": "隼人也是，四季也是，春名也是……\n大家，都非常努力呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_e:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:268cd86f555f87704ec2b871d1fce75aaad5918d295c3d652af33d8d6783e8cd",
      "text": "啊，真是佩服他们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_e:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5a005f9198f6b87aefe08a13f36ace3afb2c39f2bddb61ff6aaa49077c80ad4",
      "text": "我也觉得，社团……很开心。\n比赛……虽然很紧张，但也想加油……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_e:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b8917364077153a0a65b3db3a68a314eae67f63f9e207e25b43b240119795d8",
      "text": "比赛啊。\n明明连曲子能不能赶出来都还不知道。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_e:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29c267f9550f367676cb85775d3d518af4c85f48f2dc57a94b3cc26d26646181",
      "text": "夏来你也看了曲谱吧？\n上面明明还一片空白……哎？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_e:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52bd22a5fcd621d4c161cc2b58a301f3946fe04859d6a37100f7df770a76b012",
      "text": "（手机不见了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_f:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a3bfa4018612c9611ee0b015b05432f7bcd4fcf43b908bc8bd5edaac3404293",
      "text": "（手机……\n刚才在活动室用完，就直接落在那了吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_f:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5af461406b58165f0027178eda497b6dc75e3b06c79085b71362cc277c2a41a3",
      "text": "我把东西落在活动室了，回去拿一下。\n夏来你先回去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_f:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:839336a65fa72bbc2acc95f15dc1940ca9eacda7256a1194051d860f475fd823",
      "text": "旬……我也，一起去……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_f:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e936a3c1dafd144ace5bb7fc304dbdf69680b8b0eabc71c1d8ed9621237a19b9",
      "text": "我一个人去就行了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_f:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a45cb8b9d92f8850732e553b9b384bc355cbc86439f5057caf02fa57196e3d7c",
      "text": "可是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_f:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c42557e03c1ca1e1e952b67dd5178f34cbbde56c2e52d74b9f7e684e4908488",
      "text": "都说了没关系啦。难道说……\n你还在介意那么久以前的事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d209d8730e2357f0903504f8cceba449964f98442c5b2d167a149bd99c7e3d17",
      "text": "叫你快点忘掉啦。\n……那就，明天见。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_f:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb86b2a20b9b4bee4d4ef4961130df686c9dc45bec18cc9cf90d6f6f918f188f",
      "text": "旬……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_f:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf6f104f32b8de169549e9763e92331080c359e45759c4f677bea17ca1332b2a",
      "text": "真是的。夏来也太担心我了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_f:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5a005f9198f6b87aefe08a13f36ace3afb2c39f2bddb61ff6aaa49077c80ad4",
      "text": "我也觉得，社团活动……很开心。\n比赛……虽然很紧张，但我想加油啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_f:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f6093b960d63c71469b7af2182a9b5c578deafd473d264b5be9c373448c6325",
      "text": "……就算努力了又怎样。\n根本不会有人……在乎我的事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_g:cmd-000024:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7783277f4c4878f15e39a63c5df18807d611651ae8ea05dd4ea8afc05b94b633",
      "text": "旧冬美宅邸·钢琴房",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_g:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6f8c0dd26e4ea6f32513c3c050ca9e860785ba6e5f93807db84a856dbe83267",
      "text": "妈妈，今天也教我弹钢琴吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_g:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0c56782657870432c4b531c101fac1636c85ca0c631e747b27f1d00a5f44666",
      "text": "想听……旬弹钢琴……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_g:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe8977451500884291baedf4463ac1c354ef468b8accf4c5cc59914e0f59badb",
      "text": "好啦好啦。\n那旬就坐到妈妈身边来吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_g:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:282deafe5a3392d3eb0022b9ae2d0b1e4eeb44a00bbb413c96daa50f0579df89",
      "text": "妈妈，我弹得好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_g:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:585a5bfeb0d7f2e73597397687a1957f00da44051c9f44f7abb04ce8aa80a050",
      "text": "呵呵，弹得非常好哦。妈妈能真切地感受到\n你觉得弹琴很开心的心情呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_g:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c466175277ef4370b630fa9727828a39ea2ab8a707eacbdb535f1dbd200b849b",
      "text": "我还能弹得更好哦。听听看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_g:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c9bd4e0f09f9c01eedc55b5dc5e40946e1958461b37af4226b9ad935da924f8",
      "text": "……旬看起来，好开心。\n旬很喜欢钢琴呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_g:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:710df96fee80a95472392401cc4757fff497cb2c9f5332e4dd5e95948ce5106c",
      "text": "嗯！\n钢琴和妈妈我都最喜欢了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_g:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d695fc9c4a919a6b98de58b260722bcadca3deadced8ecf215534db043ce3007",
      "text": "（……那时候，每一天都很幸福。\n直到母亲去世的，那一天为止……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_h:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a439309fa6288a68b0e3d068e584b98ed1058f1a5591c4f448e893ebb78ff695",
      "text": "（父亲工作很忙，对我……\n一点都不关心……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_h:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdac5c656bfc40f9d02edeb8d6c6ae3b196f838f59007db562860eba5ef6ecfc",
      "text": "那个……\n过阵子有钢琴汇报演出……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_h:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b9c24498e8795a8f015c462cb478bc9fddb383180ea56543fe87dea068d2a48",
      "text": "那天我要工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_h:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b84d6edc82ed364cf907b01ac3e4afe1b6ec00bd2489569eca68a5cca55fc49",
      "text": "这是今天发下来的试卷。\n分数比上次……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_h:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b44213c664645b88e168389325e1142860c2437af7d0a64bb80701a5610b371",
      "text": "我很忙。\n放在那里吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_h:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abd7804fc3c9d9c45d0ffeba478a7de317c2bd5d547e60f15209d798db04f357",
      "text": "（就算像大家一样热衷于什么事，\n也只会觉得空虚罢了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_h:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d9451d2a99375b54152a0df7cdf09f8abe4bd29a2e211847148d0fc12331ab2",
      "text": "（反正不管怎样，根本就没人看着我）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_h:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f10f4f94d329f447538de55762f7caab2dddba8709be462300d6b0e5df61cfc9",
      "text": "……呃——那就这么弄吧。\n不对，还想要更有感觉一点啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_h:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:893427cf49acb332c92677f853bfcaebf0b1c2c035d70cf2fa3f78eb3fe68a3f",
      "text": "隼人……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_i:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4eda983020b829e7d5db7d9307a98e4dc14e7928ebd13efacd54c3a23d0679fe",
      "text": "咦？旬，你不是回去了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_i:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8a46cae3685319f4d6ec73f8eae48f20c212f0f59825aed9c35437c5a7b3696",
      "text": "只是来拿一下落下的东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_i:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6512789ed6959f2b08585c5a20526d51e9036dcbf9c8d6ea1f7db766be59607",
      "text": "这样啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_i:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8ab32991677ad6b2b5b1b5a4bcb7e3edc1439b246660fd50e3678b0aab6d1e1",
      "text": "这里按这种感觉来过渡……\n要是这样的话……这么改？不对不对……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_i:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9990737adff62758ed0a8ccf1cc12d51d22d07394279c46c5115cd208747b189",
      "text": "（啊，果然落在这里了。\n手机也找到了，快点回去吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_i:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0721d17890fd12ece88b9abccf8344c1e46c1c882f50e20bdaaf9de38a84b1f5",
      "text": "这样？但要是这样的话，这里该怎么办？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_i:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4175ec09841eb0369c72cf6b74381eae7166a26f1c39777773c10a0bad8643ad",
      "text": "唔——……这后面该怎么办啊……\n不行了，陷进死胡同了——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_i:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52209f571553054842d9cbb1b079382425b825236da7dd02d0d0185016565334",
      "text": "隼人，能打扰一下吗？\n……比如，这样改如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_i:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15c494c3290e25a765e5c98e80984ee75c0bc1df21b73df45f654a6af61cf01a",
      "text": "咦？啊，对哦！\n那后面就这样接着……嗯，好像挺不错的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_i:cmd-000165:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fefc76630d190cd2e661c8d52e45c8eeb07e1dd2287abfa3c4a2651ad408fba",
      "text": "谢谢你，旬！\n我一直在这段C段上犯愁呢，帮大忙了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_i:cmd-000170:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e65c66851b788ed9e014ecdfcbaf5c29d7898939048776a9061143a376bd5e8",
      "text": "没什么，举手之劳而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_i:cmd-000179:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c76bbde96dde32b3094be6ecc29692a8ded87dbbee6acb69060affc74c2f8353",
      "text": "真的帮了大忙啦！真不愧是旬！\n就照这个势头一口气努力到最后吧——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_i:cmd-000191:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f60b8592a67aba9a226b5bd19fdfa42a968bb7717c52bb1fd949692caa4a0f65",
      "text": "……\n……我才要谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6cc554b7d94202f7989b8594cc8ced98fbd884e66417134ac01850f0f54cb8d",
      "text": "太强啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:226bb10654fa9c1007eea0e888596d84bcafbea9a9132376e3272e1c38de8a72",
      "text": "隼人亲，这首歌超级无敌特无敌帅气啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cbf48aa8cf61fa99f598e89a7b8c6d7dde940e69a722407089ec9f4364fafd3",
      "text": "啊，超级赞不是吗！\n能写出这种曲子，真是太厉害了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:056855aa4f47bd562865c23068a3ec8a3cd12b5bad9ac044c1dff215daf8234a",
      "text": "嗯……非常，好听的曲子……\n隼人，辛苦了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f524257eae10d2469aa5455eb02e6d90c00fd1435ee727e465a9c2586c06f010",
      "text": "嘿嘿，虽然非常不容易，\n但因为有旬帮我，所以才能完成的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b91f22e8f0876f3ff5f3d5e3cfd6a1d324449d8333fc16d509d6bca6f706a6e",
      "text": "太夸张了。只是因为隼人卡壳了，\n我稍微提了点建议而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39de12d1aa73ca52c47aa845dce0cc6ec51cf939d25bf7d8e031a6d3025c6d3a",
      "text": "真不愧是，旬……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2dcd3d13b03aa828ee21a6cfc4be26b68d9f551ecac7c76a8051c34e41208ae",
      "text": "好嘞！既然他们两个都这么拼了，\n我们也不能落后啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b0b0400faf7a8f77d97143d701c5ceaf1c8f80d86ff9b8a87d44e5ae02bab5d",
      "text": "为了不和社团活动撞上，\n我去商量一下能不能调整打工的排班。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6c88b21cb3a4d9f9c4147cac78e8a92e5001fa46a99a67c58f8911e2377cdea",
      "text": "好——！我也已经考完补考了！\n从今天开始要超级拿出干劲唱歌了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000180:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6676de8e2c686e3f7d7d902564a7b9f27463994d9db6d7e743431448510b3771",
      "text": "好——嘞！\n为了大赛，大家一起努力练习吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000198:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377",
      "text": "噢——！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
